1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:03,260
(Steve Wozniak:)Nerds.

2
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,660
(Sheldon:)I'm coming, Woz, I'm coming.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,630
(Howard:)Ow!

4
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:10,980
(Sheldon:)Oh!

5
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:16,190
(Sheldon:)Aw.

6
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:34,270
Penny... Penny... Penny.

7
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:38,270
(Penny:)What up, Shel-Bot?

8
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:40,140
(Sheldon-bot:)I can't get out of bed.

9
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,520
(Sheldon-bot:)I hurt my ankle.

10
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:43,110
(Penny:)What do you want me to do?

11
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:45,440
Sing me "Soft Kitty."

12
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,150
(Penny:)Really, you want me
to sing "Soft Kitty"

13
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,780
(Penny:)to a computer monitor?

14
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:52,620
(Sheldon-bot:)Would you rather come over
and sing it to me in person?

15
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:55,910
♪ Soft kitty, warm kitty ♪

16
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,790
♪ Little ball of fur... ♪

17
00:00:57,790 --> 00:01:00,410
(Sheldon-bot:)Closer to the microphone.

18
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,710
♪ Happy kitty,
sleepy... ♪

19
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:05,980
(Sheldon:)No.

20
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:09,250
(Sheldon-bot:)You have to start over.

21
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:12,590
♪ Soft kitty,
warm kitty ♪

22
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:15,720
♪ Little ball of fur ♪

23
00:01:15,730 --> 00:01:18,530
♪ Happy kitty,
sleepy kitty ♪

24
00:01:18,530 --> 00:01:20,040
♪ Purr, purr, purr. ♪

